# Diabolic Edict: "Target player sacrifices a creature of their choice." Bot2 controls one creature, Llanowar Elves, and
# a Forest that is no creature. With no choice to make the creature is sacrificed without asking (CR 701.21a: Bot2 has no
# Choose line and none is waited for); the Forest, not a creature, stays. The Edict, an instant, goes to Bot1's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Diabolic Edict
Island x4
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x5
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Diabolic Edict.Cast(Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot1.Graveyard = Diabolic Edict
